window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>ERIN</b><br> He promised himself to another woman,<br> in exchange for saving my life.<br> I love him with all my heart.<br> I want to trust him when he promises me he’s handling it,<br> but time is running out.<br> I refuse to be his side piece.<br> It’s not just me and our son I need to think about now.<br> Because I’m pregnant with our second child.<br> <br> <b>Demyan</b><br> I made a deal with the devil,<br> because anything was better than losing Erin.<br> Even marrying Sergio’s daughter.<br> But now I’m stuck.<br> If I refuse to honor my promise,<br> I’ll lose the respect I’ve worked so hard to earn.<br> I know Sergio is playing me.<br> I just need to prove it.<br> Then I can end this sham of an engagement.<br> But if it comes down to choosing between my family and my honor,<br> I’ll choose family every time.</p> <p><b><i>Scarlet Sins</i></b> is book 2 of <b>Duet One</b> in the Yegorov Bratva series. Demyan and Erin’s story begins in <i>Scarlet Secrets</i>.</p>"; 
